<UserControl xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:vm="using:DotCharter.Tone.UI.ViewModels.PlayMode"
             xmlns:playMode="using:DotCharter.Tone.UI.Views.PlayMode"
             xmlns:conv="using:DotCharter.Tone.UI.Converters"
             xmlns:localization="clr-namespace:DotCharter.Tone.UI.Localization;assembly=DotCharter.Tone.UI"
             x:Class="DotCharter.Tone.UI.Views.PlayMode.ToneDesignCorePanel"
             x:Name="ToneDesignCorePanelRoot"
             x:DataType="vm:ToneDesignCoreViewModel">
    <!-- "Design a tone" — the AI designer, the RIGHT-HAND COLUMN of the rig's
         Tones view (RigTonesView). Reference:
         docs/agents/ui/pedalboard/ai-tone-design.md.

         This is the CORE panel, shared by DotCharter and RigLab: the prompt, the
         conversation and the answer. A host adds its own blocks through
         ExtrasTemplate (DotCharter's ToneDesignPanel puts "Match from audio" and
         "Match by section" there — both need the charting stack); RigLab adds
         none, and the slot is then never realized.

         IT READS LIKE A CONVERSATION (2026-09-27). Top to bottom: what you asked
         (a "You" bubble per request), the model's answer as ONE card — its name,
         how sure it is, the chain as chips, why it chose it, what the validator
         adjusted, what it downloaded from TONE3000 and the three things you can
         do with it — and under the whole thread the COMPOSER, pinned to the
         bottom of the column where a message box is expected: the status line,
         the box, and the one button that sends it. Before a result the box is
         the prompt and the button is Design; after one it is the refinement and
         the button is Tweak, so there is only ever one box to type into.

         TWO REGIONS, AND THE COMPOSER NEVER SCROLLS AWAY. The thread scrolls
         (ToneDesignScroll, the column's only scroller); the composer is a fixed
         row under it. The status line has a reserved height, so "Asking…",
         "12.4 s · local" and "Saved" replace each other without moving the box.

         THREE TYPE ROLES AND NO OTHERS (W4): `RigRoleTitle`, `RigRoleLabel` and
         `RigRoleBody` (`.Strong` for a row's own name). No FontSize and no
         LetterSpacing at a call site in this file; `UI/RigTypographyRoleTests`
         fails the gate if a fourth appears. A tag's or a pill's text is the
         tag's own face.

         THE CHAMFER IS THE PRIMARY ACTION AND NOTHING ELSE: one per block (the
         composer's send, the answer's Hear it), `.Body` so it reads as a verb and
         not a heading; every other action is a framed `FireGhost Compact`.

         "CHATGPT (COPY & PASTE)" (2026-09-28): a second way to send, for a
         player with a chat subscription and no API key. The composer's "Use
         ChatGPT" toggle opens a block under the send row: copy the prompt the
         box would send, paste the chat's whole answer, Import. The answer lands
         in the same card and the same thread. With NO provider configured the
         setup banner offers the same door, and the body then comes up with the
         block open and no Design button (nobody could answer it).

         The BODY still lives in a ContentControl's ContentTemplate. A template is
         not instantiated until the host is MEASURED, and Avalonia skips
         MeasureCore for an invisible element — so a collapsed panel has no body
         subtree at all rather than a hidden one. Pinned by
         Perf/ToneDesignUiPerfSmokeTests. -->

    <!-- The designer's own rules that a ControlTheme cannot hold or no theme lint
         covers (#242): scoped to this panel — and to the host's ExtrasTemplate
         blocks it presents (ToneDesignPanel's match blocks) — instead of every
         StackPanel / TextBox / PathIcon / TextBlock in the app. -->
    <UserControl.Styles>
        <Style Selector="StackPanel.FireToneThread">
            <Setter Property="Margin" Value="{StaticResource FirePadToneThread}" />
        </Style>
        <!-- The composer's box: two lines tall before a word is typed, so it reads
             as a message box and does not jump when the first line wraps. A STYLE
             and not an attribute on purpose: the box lives in the panel's body
             TEMPLATE, where a `{DynamicResource}` attribute binds at Template
             priority and `TextBox.FireFieldInput`'s own `MinHeight=0` style setter
             beat it (measured: MinHeight 0, the box 18 px tall). -->
        <Style Selector="TextBox.FireFieldInput.FireTonePrompt">
            <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="{StaticResource FireTonePromptMinHeight}" />
        </Style>
        <!-- The copy & paste route's paste box: the prompt's floor, a ceiling of its
             own (see `FireToneReplyMaxHeight`), and Enter is a newline — a pasted
             answer is several paragraphs. A style for the same reason as the prompt's:
             it lives in the body template. -->
        <Style Selector="TextBox.FireFieldInput.FireToneReply">
            <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="{StaticResource FireTonePromptMinHeight}" />
            <Setter Property="MaxHeight" Value="{StaticResource FireToneReplyMaxHeight}" />
            <Setter Property="AcceptsReturn" Value="True" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="PathIcon.FireToneGlyph">
            <Setter Property="Width" Value="14" />
            <Setter Property="Height" Value="14" />
            <Setter Property="Margin" Value="{StaticResource FireGapTopSm}" />
            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource FireTextDim}" />
        </Style>
        <Style Selector="Border.FireMatchBlock.Worse TextBlock">
            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource FireWarning}" />
        </Style>
    </UserControl.Styles>
    <Border x:Name="ToneDesignRoot" Theme="{StaticResource FireToneDesignerBorder}" Classes="FireToneDesigner">
        <Grid RowDefinitions="Auto,*">

            <!-- The header: what this column is. It opens and closes from the
                 Tones view's "AI designer" toggle, which owns IsExpanded; the
                 header is a title, not a second door onto that boolean. -->
            <Border x:Name="ToneDesignHeader" Grid.Row="0" Theme="{StaticResource FireToneDesignerHeadBorder}" Classes="FireToneDesignerHead">
                <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*">
                    <Border Grid.Column="0" Theme="{StaticResource FireTagBorder}" Classes="FireTag Accent" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <TextBlock Text="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Kicker}" />
                    </Border>
                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleTitleText}" Classes="RigRoleTitle" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                               Margin="{StaticResource FireGapLeftSm}"
                               Text="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Title}" />
                </Grid>
            </Border>

            <ContentControl Grid.Row="1" x:Name="ToneDesignBodyHost"
                            IsVisible="{Binding IsExpanded}"
                            HorizontalContentAlignment="Stretch"
                            VerticalContentAlignment="Stretch"
                            Content="{Binding}">
                <ContentControl.ContentTemplate>
                    <DataTemplate DataType="vm:ToneDesignCoreViewModel">
                        <Panel>
                            <!-- NOT CONFIGURED: one sentence and the door that
                                 fixes it. Nothing else is offered — a capability
                                 the app cannot honour must never look live. -->
                            <Border x:Name="ToneDesignSetupBanner"
                                    Theme="{StaticResource FireEmptyBannerBorder}" Classes="FireEmptyBanner Accent"
                                    Margin="{StaticResource FirePadRowLg}"
                                    VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                    MinHeight="{DynamicResource FireRigEmptyStateHeight}"
                                    IsVisible="{Binding ShowSetupBanner}">
                                <StackPanel Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceSm}"
                                            VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <TextBlock Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleBodyText}" Classes="RigRoleBody"
                                               Text="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_NotConfigured}" />
                                    <!-- The two doors: fix it in Settings, or go
                                         round it by copy & paste — which needs
                                         no provider at all. -->
                                    <WrapPanel ItemSpacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceSm}"
                                               LineSpacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceSm}">
                                        <Button Theme="{StaticResource FireGhostButton}" Classes="FireGhost Compact"
                                                Content="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_OpenSettings}"
                                                Command="{Binding OpenSettingsTabCommand}" />
                                        <Button x:Name="ToneDesignUseManual" Theme="{StaticResource FireGhostButton}" Classes="FireGhost Compact"
                                                Content="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Manual_Use}"
                                                ToolTip.Tip="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Manual_Toggle_Tip}"
                                                IsVisible="{Binding IsManualAvailable}"
                                                Command="{Binding OpenManualCommand}" />
                                    </WrapPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <Grid x:Name="ToneDesignBody" RowDefinitions="*,Auto"
                                  IsVisible="{Binding ShowBody}">

                                <!-- ══ THE THREAD ══════════════════════════════ -->
                                <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="0" x:Name="ToneDesignScroll"
                                              HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled"
                                              VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Visible"
                                              AllowAutoHide="False">
                                    <StackPanel x:Name="ToneDesignThread"
                                                Classes="FireToneThread"
                                                Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceMd}">

                                        <!-- Nothing asked yet: say what to ask for. -->
                                        <TextBlock x:Name="ToneDesignIntro" Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleBodyText}" Classes="RigRoleBody"
                                                   IsVisible="{Binding ShowIntro}"
                                                   Text="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Subtitle}" />

                                        <!-- The conversation so far. A request is a
                                             "You" bubble; an answer the thread has
                                             moved past is one line; the NEWEST
                                             answer is the card below, so it draws
                                             no row of its own. -->
                                        <ItemsControl x:Name="ToneDesignTurns" ItemsSource="{Binding Turns}">
                                            <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                                <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                                    <StackPanel Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceMd}" />
                                                </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                            </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                                <DataTemplate DataType="vm:ToneDesignTurnViewModel">
                                                    <Panel>
                                                        <Border Theme="{StaticResource FireToneTurnBorder}" Classes="FireToneTurn" IsVisible="{Binding IsUser}">
                                                            <StackPanel Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceXs}">
                                                                <TextBlock Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleLabelText}" Classes="RigRoleLabel"
                                                                           Text="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_You}" />
                                                                <TextBlock Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleBodyText}" Classes="RigRoleBody Strong" Text="{Binding Text}" />
                                                            </StackPanel>
                                                        </Border>
                                                        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*" IsVisible="{Binding IsEarlierAnswer}"
                                                              Margin="{StaticResource FireGapLeftMd}">
                                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleLabelText}" Classes="RigRoleLabel Accent"
                                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                                       Text="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Kicker}" />
                                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleBodyText}" Classes="RigRoleBody"
                                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                                       Margin="{StaticResource FireGapLeftSm}"
                                                                       Text="{Binding Text}" />
                                                        </Grid>
                                                    </Panel>
                                                </DataTemplate>
                                            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        </ItemsControl>

                                        <Border x:Name="ToneDesignError" Theme="{StaticResource FireEmptyBannerBorder}" Classes="FireEmptyBanner Danger"
                                                IsVisible="{Binding HasError}">
                                            <StackPanel Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceSm}">
                                                <TextBlock Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleBodyText}" Classes="RigRoleBody" Text="{Binding ErrorText}" />
                                                <Button Theme="{StaticResource FireGhostButton}" Classes="FireGhost Compact"
                                                        HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                        Content="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_OpenSettings}"
                                                        Command="{Binding OpenSettingsTabCommand}"
                                                        IsVisible="{Binding ErrorOffersSettings}" />
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Border>

                                        <!-- ══ THE ANSWER ══════════════════════════
                                             One card: name and confidence, the
                                             chain, why, what was adjusted, what was
                                             downloaded, and what to do with it. -->
                                        <Border x:Name="ToneDesignResult" Theme="{StaticResource FireToneAnswerBorder}" Classes="FireToneAnswer"
                                                IsVisible="{Binding ShowResult}">
                                            <StackPanel Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceMd}">
                                                <StackPanel DataContext="{Binding Result}"
                                                            x:DataType="vm:ToneDesignResultViewModel"
                                                            Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceMd}">

                                                    <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceXxs}">
                                                            <TextBlock Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleLabelText}" Classes="RigRoleLabel Accent"
                                                                       Text="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Kicker}" />
                                                            <TextBlock x:Name="ToneDesignResultName"
                                                                       Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleBodyText}" Classes="RigRoleBody Strong"
                                                                       Text="{Binding ToneName}" />
                                                        </StackPanel>
                                                        <Border Grid.Column="1" Theme="{StaticResource FireStatusPillBorder}" Classes="FireStatusPill Accent"
                                                                VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                                                Margin="{StaticResource FireGapLeftMd}"
                                                                ToolTip.Tip="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Confidence}">
                                                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"
                                                                        Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceXs}">
                                                                <Border Theme="{StaticResource FireDotBorder}" Classes="FireDot Small" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                                                <TextBlock Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleLabelText}" Classes="RigRoleLabel Accent"
                                                                           VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                                           Text="{Binding ConfidenceText}" />
                                                            </StackPanel>
                                                        </Border>
                                                    </Grid>

                                                    <!-- The chain, one chip per unit in
                                                         signal order, each lit in its
                                                         family's colour — the same
                                                         identity the board draws. -->
                                                    <StackPanel Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceXs}">
                                                        <TextBlock Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleLabelText}" Classes="RigRoleLabel"
                                                                   Text="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Chain}" />
                                                        <ItemsControl x:Name="ToneDesignChain"
                                                                      ItemsSource="{Binding ChainSteps}">
                                                            <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                                                <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                                                    <WrapPanel ItemSpacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceXs}"
                                                                               LineSpacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceXs}" />
                                                                </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                                            </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                                                <DataTemplate DataType="vm:ToneChainStep">
                                                                    <Border Theme="{StaticResource FireToneStepBorder}" Classes="FireToneStep">
                                                                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"
                                                                                    Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceXs}">
                                                                            <Border Theme="{StaticResource FireToneStepDotBorder}" Classes="FireToneStepDot"
                                                                                    Background="{Binding TokenKey, Converter={x:Static conv:FireTokenBrushConverter.Instance}}" />
                                                                            <TextBlock Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleBodyText}" Classes="RigRoleBody"
                                                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                                                       Text="{Binding Name}" />
                                                                        </StackPanel>
                                                                    </Border>
                                                                </DataTemplate>
                                                            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                                        </ItemsControl>
                                                    </StackPanel>

                                                    <!-- Why: half of the answer, so it is
                                                         shown, not folded behind a link. -->
                                                    <StackPanel Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceXs}"
                                                                IsVisible="{Binding HasRationale}">
                                                        <TextBlock Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleLabelText}" Classes="RigRoleLabel"
                                                                   Text="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Rationale}" />
                                                        <TextBlock x:Name="ToneDesignRationale" Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleBodyText}" Classes="RigRoleBody"
                                                                   Text="{Binding Rationale}" />
                                                    </StackPanel>

                                                    <StackPanel Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceXs}"
                                                                IsVisible="{Binding HasWarnings}">
                                                        <TextBlock Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleLabelText}" Classes="RigRoleLabel Warn"
                                                                   Text="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Warnings}" />
                                                        <TextBlock Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleBodyText}" Classes="RigRoleBody" Text="{Binding WarningsText}" />
                                                    </StackPanel>

                                                    <!-- A capture the design fetched from
                                                         TONE3000 is credited here, author
                                                         and licence, the way the capture
                                                         browser credits a download. -->
                                                    <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*"
                                                          IsVisible="{Binding HasDownloadedCaptures}">
                                                        <PathIcon Grid.Column="0" Classes="FireToneGlyph"
                                                                  VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                                                  Data="{DynamicResource IconDownload}" />
                                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" x:Name="ToneDesignDownloadedCaptures"
                                                                   Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleBodyText}" Classes="RigRoleBody"
                                                                   Margin="{StaticResource FireGapLeftSm}"
                                                                   Text="{Binding DownloadedCapturesText}" />
                                                    </Grid>
                                                </StackPanel>

                                                <Border Theme="{StaticResource FireRuleBorder}" Classes="FireRule" />

                                                <WrapPanel x:Name="ToneDesignActions"
                                                           ItemSpacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceSm}"
                                                           LineSpacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceSm}">
                                                    <Button x:Name="ToneDesignHearIt" Theme="{StaticResource FirePrimaryButton}" Classes="FirePrimary Body"
                                                            Content="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_HearIt}"
                                                            Command="{Binding HearItCommand}" />
                                                    <Button x:Name="ToneDesignSave" Theme="{StaticResource FireGhostButton}" Classes="FireGhost Compact"
                                                            Content="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Save}"
                                                            Command="{Binding SaveToneCommand}" />
                                                    <Button x:Name="ToneDesignDiscard" Theme="{StaticResource FireGhostButton}" Classes="FireGhost Compact"
                                                            Content="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Discard}"
                                                            Command="{Binding DiscardCommand}" />
                                                </WrapPanel>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Border>

                                        <!-- The HOST's blocks (see the header). A
                                             template rather than a control, so a
                                             collapsed panel realizes none of it; and
                                             invisible while there is none, so it is
                                             never templated at all. The rule parts
                                             them from the conversation above: they
                                             are other ways INTO an answer, not part
                                             of this one. -->
                                        <!-- …and only while a provider is set up: the
                                             body is also on screen for the copy &
                                             paste route alone, and the host's blocks
                                             were built for a configured designer. -->
                                        <StackPanel Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceMd}"
                                                    IsVisible="{Binding IsConfigured}">
                                            <Border Theme="{StaticResource FireRuleBorder}" Classes="FireRule"
                                                    IsVisible="{Binding ExtrasTemplate, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=playMode:ToneDesignCorePanel}, Converter={x:Static ObjectConverters.IsNotNull}}" />
                                            <ContentControl x:Name="ToneDesignExtrasHost"
                                                            Content="{Binding}"
                                                            ContentTemplate="{Binding ExtrasTemplate, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=playMode:ToneDesignCorePanel}}"
                                                            IsVisible="{Binding ExtrasTemplate, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=playMode:ToneDesignCorePanel}, Converter={x:Static ObjectConverters.IsNotNull}}" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </ScrollViewer>

                                <!-- ══ THE COMPOSER ════════════════════════════
                                     Pinned under the thread: the box, then ONE row
                                     under it — what is happening (or why the button
                                     is grey) on the left, Cancel and the send button
                                     on the right. The row is as tall as the button,
                                     so progress, cost and "saved" replace each other
                                     without moving anything, and an idle composer
                                     has no empty status band. -->
                                <Border Grid.Row="1" x:Name="ToneDesignComposer" Theme="{StaticResource FireToneComposerBorder}" Classes="FireToneComposer">
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceSm}">
                                        <!-- ONE box: the prompt until there is an
                                             answer, the refinement after. Enter
                                             sends. -->
                                        <Border Theme="{StaticResource FireFieldBorder}" Classes="FireField Tall">
                                            <Panel>
                                                <TextBox x:Name="ToneDesignPrompt"
                                                         Classes="FireFieldInput Multiline FireTonePrompt"
                                                         TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                         IsVisible="{Binding !HasResult}"
                                                         Text="{Binding Description, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                         PlaceholderText="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_PromptHint}"
                                                         AutomationProperties.Name="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_PromptHint}">
                                                    <TextBox.KeyBindings>
                                                        <KeyBinding Gesture="Enter" Command="{Binding DesignCommand}" />
                                                    </TextBox.KeyBindings>
                                                </TextBox>
                                                <TextBox x:Name="ToneDesignTweak"
                                                         Classes="FireFieldInput Multiline FireTonePrompt"
                                                         TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                         IsVisible="{Binding HasResult}"
                                                         Text="{Binding TweakText, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                         PlaceholderText="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_TweakHint}"
                                                         AutomationProperties.Name="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_TweakHint}">
                                                    <TextBox.KeyBindings>
                                                        <KeyBinding Gesture="Enter" Command="{Binding TweakCommand}" />
                                                    </TextBox.KeyBindings>
                                                </TextBox>
                                            </Panel>
                                        </Border>

                                        <!-- A DISABLED CONTROL STATES ITS REASON OR
                                             IS NOT RENDERED, and Design is the block's
                                             own VERB — so it stays, and the line
                                             beside it says why it is grey. -->
                                        <Grid x:Name="ToneDesignSendRow" ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto,Auto,Auto"
                                              MinHeight="{StaticResource FireToneStatusHeight}">
                                            <!-- Two lines at most, so no status can
                                                 outgrow the button beside it and push
                                                 the box up; the full line is its
                                                 tooltip. -->
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" x:Name="ToneDesignStatus"
                                                       Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleLabelText}" Classes="RigRoleLabel"
                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                       MaxLines="2" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"
                                                       Margin="{StaticResource FireGapRightMd}"
                                                       ToolTip.Tip="{Binding Status}"
                                                       Text="{Binding Status}"
                                                       IsVisible="{Binding HasStatus}" />
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" x:Name="ToneDesignNeedsPrompt"
                                                       Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleLabelText}" Classes="RigRoleLabel"
                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                       MaxLines="2" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"
                                                       Margin="{StaticResource FireGapRightMd}"
                                                       IsVisible="{Binding ShowPromptHint}"
                                                       Text="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_NeedsPrompt}" />
                                            <!-- The second way to send: opens the copy &
                                                 paste block under this row. -->
                                            <ToggleButton Grid.Column="1" x:Name="ToneDesignManualToggle"
                                                          Theme="{StaticResource FireGhostToggle}" Classes="FireGhost Compact"
                                                          VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                          Margin="{StaticResource FireGapRightMd}"
                                                          IsVisible="{Binding IsManualAvailable}"
                                                          IsChecked="{Binding IsManualOpen, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                          Content="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Manual_Toggle}"
                                                          ToolTip.Tip="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Manual_Toggle_Tip}" />
                                            <Button Grid.Column="2" x:Name="ToneDesignCancel" Theme="{StaticResource FireGhostButton}" Classes="FireGhost Compact"
                                                    VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                    Margin="{StaticResource FireGapRightMd}"
                                                    Content="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Cancel}"
                                                    Command="{Binding CancelCommand}"
                                                    IsVisible="{Binding IsRunning}" />
                                            <Panel Grid.Column="3" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                <Button x:Name="ToneDesignRun" Theme="{StaticResource FirePrimaryButton}" Classes="FirePrimary Body"
                                                        Content="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Design}"
                                                        IsVisible="{Binding ShowDesignButton}"
                                                        Command="{Binding DesignCommand}" />
                                                <Button x:Name="ToneDesignRefine" Theme="{StaticResource FirePrimaryButton}" Classes="FirePrimary Body"
                                                        Content="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Tweak}"
                                                        IsVisible="{Binding ShowTweakButton}"
                                                        Command="{Binding TweakCommand}" />
                                            </Panel>
                                        </Grid>

                                        <!-- ══ CHATGPT (COPY & PASTE) ══════════════════
                                             Compact on purpose, because it sits in
                                             the PINNED composer and every pixel it
                                             takes comes out of the thread: the
                                             title with step 1's button, the paste
                                             box (its placeholder is step 2) at a
                                             low cap, and Import with the error
                                             beside it. The instructions are the
                                             buttons' tooltips. A bad paste says so
                                             HERE and touches nothing else. -->
                                        <Border x:Name="ToneDesignManual" Theme="{StaticResource FireToneManualBorder}" Classes="FireToneManual"
                                                IsVisible="{Binding IsManualOpen}">
                                            <StackPanel Spacing="{StaticResource FireSpaceSm}">
                                                <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleLabelText}" Classes="RigRoleLabel Accent"
                                                               VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                               Margin="{StaticResource FireGapRightMd}"
                                                               Text="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Manual_Title}" />
                                                    <Button Grid.Column="1" x:Name="ToneDesignCopyPrompt"
                                                            Theme="{StaticResource FireGhostButton}" Classes="FireGhost Compact"
                                                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                            Content="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Manual_Copy}"
                                                            ToolTip.Tip="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Manual_Step1}"
                                                            Command="{Binding CopyPromptCommand}" />
                                                </Grid>
                                                <Border Theme="{StaticResource FireFieldBorder}" Classes="FireField Tall">
                                                    <TextBox x:Name="ToneDesignReply"
                                                             Classes="FireFieldInput Multiline FireToneReply"
                                                             TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                             Text="{Binding ReplyText, Mode=TwoWay}"
                                                             PlaceholderText="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Manual_Step2}"
                                                             AutomationProperties.Name="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Manual_Step2}" />
                                                </Border>
                                                <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                                                    <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" x:Name="ToneDesignManualError"
                                                               Theme="{StaticResource RigRoleBodyText}" Classes="RigRoleBody Danger"
                                                               VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                               Margin="{StaticResource FireGapRightMd}"
                                                               IsVisible="{Binding HasManualError}"
                                                               Text="{Binding ManualErrorText}" />
                                                    <Button Grid.Column="1" x:Name="ToneDesignImport"
                                                            Theme="{StaticResource FireGhostButton}" Classes="FireGhost Compact"
                                                            VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                                            Content="{localization:Loc ToneDesign_Manual_Import}"
                                                            Command="{Binding ImportReplyCommand}" />
                                                </Grid>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Border>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>
                            </Grid>
                        </Panel>
                    </DataTemplate>
                </ContentControl.ContentTemplate>
            </ContentControl>
        </Grid>
    </Border>
</UserControl>
